.DS_Store

# Rust
target/
# `.github/workflows/build-matrix.yml` builds each uploaded bridge binary here,
# one package per invocation, so no `cargo test` step overwrites an artifact a
# release job then Authenticode-signs.
target-shipped/
rust_out

